WEBVTT

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.460
You...

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:10.390
Have you...

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:18.240
Courage, love, friendship, kindness, sadness, and joy.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:22.530
Within all our hearts lie countless emotions.

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:24.850
I shall fight!

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:27.840
And I shall protect everyone's hearts!

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:38.500
Precure!

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.060
Open My Heart!

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:06.960
A lone flower, sparkling in the Moon's glow!

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.690
Cure Moonlight!

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:18.180
HeartCatch

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:19.640
Precure!

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:23.180
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:26.190
Now, all together

00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:28.700
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:31.700
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:39.280
Within each of our chests,

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:41.950
they begin to sprout

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.630
The seeds of the heart

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:44.870
are growing

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:47.490
bit by bit

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:48.170
Red,

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:48.790
white

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:50.100
and yellow

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:52.840
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:54.300
all varied colors

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:55.780
that they

00:01:55.850 --> 00:01:57.930
shine so brightly!

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:03.270
That smile that you've nurtured

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:05.770
with such care

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:08.490
will never wither

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:12.070
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:14.940
Now, all together

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:17.400
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.070
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:25.010
They're always right by our sides

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:25.840
So together

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:29.670
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:32.630
bloom even more!

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:34.130
HeartCatch

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:35.630
Precure!

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:54.070
Cure Moonlight...

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:58.150
...has returned!

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:03.530
C-Cure Moonlight?!

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:07.830
Yuri finally managed to become Cure Moonlight again!

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:11.140
Y-You don't even have a fairy!

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:13.170
How did you become a Precure again?!

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:16.520
Cologne's body may indeed have been destroyed back then,

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:20.930
but his spirit was protected by the Great Heart Tree!

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.350
Back then...

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:32.220
Dark Forte Wave!{ep 1 flashback using ep 1 effects}

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:40.610
Out of the way!

00:03:41.370 --> 00:03:45.830
My fairies... seek out my replacement!

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:12.760
Lord Coupe?

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:27.620
I should've finished you off back then when I had the chance!

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:41.010
Damn you!

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.990
I won't give up...

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:08.700
until every heart is filled with light!

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:16.960
What Incredible Power<i>!</i>

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:16.960
What Incredible Power<i>!</i>

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.510
I'm not the same as when I lost Cologne.

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:38.140
Moonlight Reflection!

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:56.270
There you go.

00:05:57.560 --> 00:06:00.180
You three?! What are you doing here?!

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:03.920
Sabark's orders. He asked us to keep an eye out for you.

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:06.970
Cure Moonlight has returned?

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:09.080
Things certainly have gotten interesting!

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:11.380
I'll be the one to defeat Moonlight!

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:13.100
Don't interfere!

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.440
No can do, I'm afraid.

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:19.730
Moonlight's foiled our splendid plans many a time too, after all.

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.800
That was but my greeting, madame.

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:36.130
Dark Bracelet!

00:06:57.280 --> 00:06:58.350
Moonlight!

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:02.550
Kobraja! Don't interfere!

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.090
We have to save Moonlight!

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:19.330
You'll be fighting us three, I'm afraid!

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:21.770
Dark Bracelet!

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:28.230
You see, the Dark Bracelet doesn't merely empower our Desertrians.

00:07:28.230 --> 00:07:31.680
It powers us up as well!

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:35.930
Here I come!

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:01.230
Let's go!

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:07.590
Marine Shoot!

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:19.290
If anyone is truly worthy of challenging my beauty, it would be you, Sunshine.

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.560
Sunflower Aegis!

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:35.240
I-It's not going to hold!

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:37.470
Adieu!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:48.790
Sunshine!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.070
You're wide open!

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:53.710
Blossom!

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:05.980
Gather, Floral Power!

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:07.520
Moon Tact!

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:10.020
Dark Power, Gather!

00:09:10.990 --> 00:09:12.360
Dark Tact!

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:14.630
Flowers, shine forth!

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:18.070
Precure Silver Forte Wave!

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.810
Dark Forte Wave!

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:30.880
Dark Precure, why do you hate me so much?!

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:32.520
Because you...

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:35.590
Because you are me!

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:37.440
Cure Moonlight!

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:41.220
What do you mean by "I am you"?!

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:44.930
If you are the Moon's light, then I am its shadow!

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:54.270
It's only once the light has been enveloped by shadow that the Moon can truly be whole!

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:10.920
Now the Moon shall become one!

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:17.880
Cure Moonlight.

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:26.850
Cure Moonlight.

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:30.960
Cologne?

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:36.140
Cure Moonlight!

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:44.450
That's right.

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:49.330
I'm not alone anymore.

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:54.750
I don't have to fight alone!

00:10:56.560 --> 00:10:58.580
As long as Cologne watches over me,

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:02.090
there's no way I can lose!

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:05.990
Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:10.960
Dark Power Fortissimo!

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:53.710
What?!

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:16.520
Sabark!

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:26.290
You're Dark Precure's...

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:47.510
Now I finally get to give you a
 taste of my lovely poison sting!

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:51.850
Blossom!

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:01.520
Huh?

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:23.170
Say your prayers!

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:48.200
Curse you!

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:53.620
Moonlight Silver Impact!

00:15:08.350 --> 00:15:09.970
Leave the rest to us!

00:15:19.340 --> 00:15:22.040
Gather, Floral Power!

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:26.600
Shiny Tambourine!

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:42.960
Flowers, dance for me!

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:47.900
Precure Gold Forte Burst!

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:57.780
Gather, Dual Floral Power!

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:03.970
Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:16.680
Precure Shining Fortissimo!

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:22.820
This is bad. They're going to purify us!

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:25.920
Don't think we'll forget about this!

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:39.100
Cure Sunshine!

00:16:41.590 --> 00:16:44.440
Now all four Precure are finally together!

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:59.090
Moonlight, what happened to Dark Precure?

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:07.000
Just as I was about to finish her, Sabark appeared, and they vanished together.

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:13.090
It's fine! Now that we have Moonlight, we're like a hundred times stronger!

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:17.440
Even if Dark Precure shows up, or the Desert Apostles, we'll...

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:21.510
What's the phrase I'm looking for?

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:23.930
It's "We'll beat them and be back in time for breakfast."

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:26.390
Yeah, that's the one!

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:29.150
You shouldn't treat the Desert Apostles so lightly.

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:33.860
That's true. The Desert Apostles will keep on attacking.

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:38.340
So let's work together and protect the Great Heart Tree!

00:17:48.550 --> 00:17:52.210
You really did well out there, Cure Moonlight.

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:55.380
Not really. It's all thanks to you, Cologne.

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:58.840
I heard your voice when you called to me.

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:06.980
It looks like the Flower of your Heart has recovered nicely.

00:18:25.390 --> 00:18:26.200
Thank you,

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:28.080
Cologne.

00:18:45.590 --> 00:18:46.260
What?

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:53.650
Cologne?!

00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:14.640
You really are such a crybaby.

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:05.780
Things got kinda crazy out there, didn't they?

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:08.610
I'm starving after all that.

00:20:08.610 --> 00:20:11.350
Well, it <i>has</i> gotten pretty late.

00:20:11.740 --> 00:20:14.210
There they are!

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:19.150
Erika! Where have you been all this time?!

00:20:19.660 --> 00:20:21.620
Oh, sorry!

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:23.890
Some stuff came up, you see...

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:28.160
So did Yuri agree to appear in the fashion show?!

00:20:29.480 --> 00:20:35.290
W-Well, the thing is... She hasn't actually given me the okay yet.

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:37.150
Whaaaat?!

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:41.720
Yuri, will you please come star in our fashion show?!

00:20:42.350 --> 00:20:43.590
Please!

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:50.480
You mean it?!

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:56.060
All right!

00:20:57.140 --> 00:21:01.880
But we haven't even made a single outfit for Yuri to wear yet.

00:21:01.880 --> 00:21:05.340
We haven't even taken measurements yet. Can we really get it done in time?

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:07.810
Who do you think I am? {Edited, yeah yeah. Also changed duration.}

00:21:07.810 --> 00:21:12.830
Who needs measuring when I can tell Yuri's three sizes at a glance?

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:13.790
Huh?!

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:32.350
Yuri's three sizes are...

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:38.940
How on earth did you do that?!

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:41.130
You really are amazing, Erika!

00:21:41.130 --> 00:21:42.200
All right then!

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:47.110
Now that that's done, let's all go back to Fairy Drop and make Yuri some dresses! {Added second 'that'}

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:48.990
Yeah!

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:52.150
We need to work hard!

00:21:55.780 --> 00:21:57.880
Yuri, let's go!

00:21:57.880 --> 00:21:58.900
Huh?

00:21:58.900 --> 00:22:00.310
Here we go!

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:17.980
So come on, let's sing together in harmony!

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.190
Come on, all together now!

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:25.690
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:27.070 --> 00:22:32.660
When you give life your all, within your heart

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:38.250
a shining flower begins to bloom

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:47.220
So when you feel like crying, raise your head

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:53.930
and you'll see everyone's there by your side!

00:22:54.800 --> 00:22:59.980
So let's dance together, hand in hand!

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:04.400
All those

00:23:04.570 --> 00:23:09.000
happy feelings will be shared amongst us!

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:14.240
Lose yourself is the melody!

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:16.910
Yay, yay, hey!

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:21.130
And tomorrow will bring even more Hallelujahs!

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:27.260
So come on! Let's make the Flowers of our Hearts bloom!

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:31.300
With all our might!

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:34.640
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:37.810
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.880 --> 00:23:45.650
<i>Let's have a cheer for the return of Cure Moonlight!</i>

00:23:45.650 --> 00:23:47.020
<i>Hip, hip...</i>

00:23:47.020 --> 00:23:48.150
<i>Hooray!</i>

00:23:48.150 --> 00:23:49.280
<i>Nice to be working with you!</i>

00:23:49.280 --> 00:23:51.530
<i>But now it's a mad dash to get ready for the school festival!</i>

00:23:51.530 --> 00:23:53.070
<i>I'm really not sure we'll be ready.</i>

00:23:53.070 --> 00:23:56.720
<i>No need to worry! We'll make sure it's all done on time!</i>

00:23:56.720 --> 00:23:59.700
<i>I swear it as leader of the Fashion Club!</i>

00:24:01.020 --> 00:24:02.770
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:02.790 --> 00:24:06.090
We Can't Wait for the School Festival<i>!</i>

00:24:02.790 --> 00:24:06.090
We Can't Wait for the School Festival<i>!</i>

00:24:06.450 --> 00:24:08.420
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
